WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.740
Bingo! I'll use this!

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:36.820
Episode 8

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:36.820
Emergency Launch! X Tornado

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.220
What's going on?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.390
What's the situation?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:52.610
We verified that a rocket was launched five minutes ago, but nothing else at the moment.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:57.530
I wonder what Dr. Eggman is up to next.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.620
Have you identified the object that was launched?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.450
Not yet.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.840
It will reach the scheduled altitude soon.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.590
I guess it's time to begin.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.640
Super Sweeper!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.150
Red alert!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.480
What's going on?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.400
Satellite communication has been jammed! Correction - the satellite has disappeared!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.530
What?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:46.030
What's going on?

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:55.130
It's sucking them up.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:02.510
I know! I'll use the satellites I collected for robot parts.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:07.850
That will kill two birds with one stone. I'm a genius.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.350
What's happening?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.770
Call the President!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.830
What do you say in the morning? Good morning.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:32.540
What do you say in the morning? Good morning.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.210
Snack time.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:47.050
Ella and I made these apple pies.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.600
Amy has a talent for baking.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.060
The pies are delicious again.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.650
I'm so happy! I'm sure Sonic will also like them!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.150
I'll bring it to him.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.360
No! I'm taking it to him!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.030
Tails, how could you?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.570
I'm sorry.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.790
The Next Show is going to end!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.250
Don't worry. It'll be fine in a jiffy.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.210
Huh? That's weird.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.670
The TV is dead!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.430
What's the racket?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.470
Sonic.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.100
The TV isn't working.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.230
Is that a big problem?

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.390
Well…

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.520
I can't watch the Next Show!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.610
I can't believe it. I can't even watch the cooking show.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.490
We can't watch Mrs. Thorndyke's movies either.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.610
Nor samurai movies.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.410
That's beside the point.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.000
Why are you hiding? Come over here.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:09.010
I have a message from Dr. Eggman. Pay attention.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.300
Are you scared now, Sonic?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:16.520
You pumpkinheads can't even imagine what's happening.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.940
Look at this!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.150
That thing swallowed the satellites.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.690
My samurai movies...

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:30.030
People in this world like to stick their noses into other people's business.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.370
That's why I'm punishing them.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:37.000
It's pointless to think about doing anything against E-90.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:41.040
Because E-90 is in the stratosphere.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:46.760
Sonic, your lame robots can't reach it no matter how hard you try.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.840
So what will you do?

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.720
This robot will now automatically cry.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.640
Stratosphere?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:06.150
I still don't know much about this world, but judging from Eggman's statement…

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:10.570
To put it in simple terms, it means it's super high up in the sky!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.780
What a noisy robot.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.120
Don't do it.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.660
I did it!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.170
What do you mean by super high up?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.180
It's somewhere around here.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.510
We can make it there using Tornado.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.510
Let's give it a try.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.890
Come on, Tails!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.520
Wait, Sonic!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.690
Let's go, Sonic!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.860
Okay!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.410
Tails, Sonic! Give it your best shot!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:01.330
What?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.250
E-90, destroy them!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.880
You can't hit me!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.300
Charge in!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.600
What a slow robot.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.600
Don't let your guard down, Tails.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.610
I'm fine. You can leave it to me this time.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.420
Where are they?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.420
Now!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.930
Chase after it!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.430
Okay, Sonic.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.330
The battle's only begun!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.710
Whatever.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.930
Playtime's over!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.020
Super Sweeper!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:53.030
Break free, Tails!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.420
That thing is faster.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.460
Because it's lighter!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.930
Unbelievable! It even swallowed up the clouds!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.730
Oh no!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:16.510
The enemy was stronger than we thought.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:18.930
Tails.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:23.350
It's currently not fast enough.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.520
Can you upgrade the Tornado, Tails?

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.770
There is a way.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.150
Really?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.990
We can use the Chaos Emerald.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.950
But the problem is...

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.660
Energy conversion.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.370
What do you mean?

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:46.290
Although the Chaos Emerald possesses great energy, the problem is energy conversion.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:53.840
There's no system that can convert the energy with one hundred percent efficiency, and the extra energy is unstable.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.760
Then what can we do?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.970
I think there's a way to discharge the extra energy.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:03.270
But that won't help us defeat the robot!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.390
Is there any other way?

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.350
A backup booster could be put here.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.900
At the same time, we can lower the settings of the of the energy converter unit.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:16.900
That means we also have to tune the engine.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:21.160
The engine wasn't designed for the Chaos Emerald.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.830
Why don't we add more backup boosters?

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.920
The chances of failure will decrease.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:32.710
If so, we have to change the chassis. It will be a major overhaul.

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.710
I know you can do it, Tails.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:38.840
Like Sonic says, you and I can do it.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.720
Come with me.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.900
Where are we?

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.900
This is my secret base!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.150
Wow!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.280
Chuck, what is this?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.280
Do you like it?

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:00.570
Yeah!

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.450
Okay, let's get to work!

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.540
Right!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.750
What about this?

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.170
I see.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:22.300
If you don't take a break, you'll get sick.

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.810
I know, but I only have a little more to do.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.660
The TV is working again!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:56.380
Good morning! Everybody, welcome to the Dr. Eggman channel.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:01.760
This program is brought to you via satellite from a happy island in the south.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.430
I don't like this!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:10.810
Today's special broadcast is about the plan to clean up the trash in the stratosphere.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:11.810
Cue.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:16.860
The reporter is the world's most favorite idol, Dr. Eggman.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:21.700
Your hearts will be hooked on me, baby!

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.370
The enemy robot has taken off.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.500
Are the satellites ready to fire their lasers?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:31.660
Yes!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:35.330
Sonic!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.130
Is it ready?

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.470
It's perfect! I'll tell everybody!

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.880
This is the X Tornado.

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:30.470
Locked on target!

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:32.470
Super Sweeper!

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:34.440
Fire!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.570
No way!

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.910
How annoying. E-90, swallow all the satellites!

00:15:58.750 --> 00:15:59.840
Let's go, Tails.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:03.010
Wait. I want you to take me along this time.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:07.220
Don't be unreasonable Chris. X Tornado is a two-seater.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:08.510
Tails...

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:13.310
Actually Sonic, I'm sorry to keep this quiet from you...

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.480
I asked Tails to make it.

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:22.190
You don't mind do you, Sonic?

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.740
Sonic.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.780
You have to promise not to get in the way, buddy.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.240
Then that's decided.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.630
The first and second wings are set.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.800
Standby for take off!

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:59.190
I'm so excited! I've always wanted to do this!

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:05.190
Go X Tornado!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.700
Take off!

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:23.170
Retract landing gear. Setting up third and fourth wings.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.680
Dr. Eggman, something is approaching E-90.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.100
And it's fast.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.100
It's the hedgehog and the fox cub.

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.940
Fine, I'll face them this time.

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:49.740
Here we go!

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.790
I'll provide backup, Sonic!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:08.590
Thank you!

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.670
Damn!

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.840
I'll swat that annoying fly down first!

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:21.600
I can't get any closer!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.120
Sonic is so cool!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:48.880
Whoa.

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.810
Next is...

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.320
Just watch! Turning on booster switch!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.750
Sonic, watch out!

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:33.380
Damn! I'll have to use my last resort!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.220
I won't lose this time!

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.770
Sonic seems cold.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.900
It's because we're approaching the stratosphere.

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:57.030
The temperature drops down to about -50 degrees, but Sonic can easily withstand that.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:05.870
Are you sure everything's okay?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:07.790
Piece of cake!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.420
It's still no big deal.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:17.130
Oh no! Sonic is frozen!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:23.560
I know! The ring!

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:26.270
I can't fire it.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.610
At this rate, we're doomed!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.110
I think there's a way to discharge the extra energy.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.110
Oh yeah.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.200
Please, Chris.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.830
There's a yellow cable under the seat.

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:44.290
Connect it to the ring.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.250
What will happen?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.120
There's no time. Hurry!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.250
Okay.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.790
The fun's just started!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.080
Turn around and charge!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.420
Okay!

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.600
We did it!

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:58.490
He is a real samurai.

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.630
This is Ella's special chili soup.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:22.050
Drink this and warm yourself up.

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:25.510
You did a lot this time, Sonic.

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:27.310
You're wrong.

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:32.230
The heroes this time were Tails, Chris and X Tornado.

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:34.270
Hooray!

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.770
Look, look!

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:39.480
I made all this ice cream for Sonic.

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:43.240
Too cool.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.600
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:59.120
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:59.120
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:02.520
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:06.690
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:12.720
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:12.720
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:16.330
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:25.960
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:40.640
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.200
